NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE — the guide's content

Everything the site displays (topics, maintenance schedules, explanations, links)
is written and maintained by the Saudi Mazda owners' community, primarily through
https://t.me/mzda6 and the channels around it, in their Google Doc:
https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Yj0AP9xVrkLqIf01mdelU4m4OcQR-NGxuTNYpGeiIvM/edit

That content belongs to them. This repository only reads it and generates a view;
it never writes back. The generated site credits them on every screen and carries
the document's own disclaimer: المعلومات الوارده لأغراض نشر الثقافه فقط.

If you are one of the maintainers and want this mirror changed or taken down,
open an issue and it will be done.
